[5.511, "o", "\r\n[assistant]\r\nThe image shows a coronal CT scan of the chest. The heart appears enlarged with a large mass effect on surrounding structures. There is a notable area of increased density within the left atrium, which could indicate a thrombus or tumor.\r\n\r\n**UMLS Concepts:**\r\n- Coronary Artery Disease (C0085550)\r\n- Cardiac Hypertrophy (C0027306)\r\n- Left Atrial Thrombosis (C0442892)\r\n\r\n```json\r\n{\r\n  \"caption\": \"Coronal CT scan showing an enlarged heart with a large mass effect and a dense area in the left atrium.\",\r\n  \"cuis\": [\r\n    \"C0085550\",\r\n    \"C0027306\",\r\n    \"C0442892\"\r\n  ]\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\n[human] (/next, /quit) > "]
